<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Game Q3 cut, Q4 raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Game Q3 cut, Q4 raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Friday, while maintaining its $1.08 full-year (September) FY97 estimate on International Game Technology, it reduced its Q3 projection to $0.29 from $0.31 and raised its Q4 outlook to $0.31 from $0.27.</p>
<p>--For FY98, EVEREN increased its EPS estimate to $1.25 from $1.20, based on reduced shares outstanding.</p>
<p>--International Game ended unchanged at 16-1/8.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
